  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0220","idiomatic","Then set that segment's first-day motion parts to one hundred, divide the difference for days with the remainder as parts, and add or subtract the result from the fixed accumulation — add for morning appearance and subtract for evening concealment.","Then add one hundred parts to that segment's first-day motion parts, divide the difference for days with the remainder as parts, and add or subtract the result from the fixed accumulation — add for morning appearance and subtract for evening concealment.","In this calendrical register 如一百 is additive, parallel to s0218 一百分加其日行分; the before wrongly equates 初日行分 to one hundred, and the proposed add-one-hundred reading restores the correct divisor construction.","high","applied"],
    ["s0220","literal","Then set that segment's first-day motion parts equal to one hundred, divide the difference for days, what does not fill, reduce back for parts; the result is used to add or subtract the fixed accumulation — add for morning appearance and subtract for evening concealment.","Then set that segment's first-day motion parts and add one hundred, divide the difference for days, what does not fill, reduce back for parts; the result is used to add or subtract the fixed accumulation — add for morning appearance and subtract for evening concealment.","Same 如一百 is an addend after 置其段初日行分, not an equality; the before's 'equal to one hundred' invents equating, and the proposed 'add one hundred' matches the formula sense already used in s0218.","high","applied"],
    ["s0250","literal","Subtract the excess-deficit parts by the distance-from-conjunction difference day — that is the distance-from-conjunction difference degree;","Subtract the distance-from-conjunction difference day from the excess-deficit parts — that is the distance-from-conjunction difference degree;","以距合差日減盈縮分 is standard 以A減B (B−A): subtract 距合差日 from 盈縮分; the before reverses the operands, and the proposed wording matches the already-correct idiomatic for this unit.","high","applied"],
    ["s0256","idiomatic","Then subtract one hundred parts from that segment's first-day motion parts, divide the difference by the remainder for days with the remainder as parts, and add or subtract the result from the general-use accumulation — add for morning appearance and subtract for evening concealment.","Then set that segment's first-day motion parts and overturn-subtract them from one hundred parts; use the remainder to divide the difference, obtaining days, and reduce back any shortfall into parts; add or subtract the result from the general-use accumulation — add for morning appearance and subtract for evening concealment.","覆減一百分 after 置其段初日行分 means overturn-subtract the first-day motion from one hundred (100−初日行分), as in s0255 覆減周天度; the before subtracts one hundred from the motion parts and reverses the operands.","high","applied"],
    ["s0261","idiomatic","Then subtract one hundred parts from that segment's first-day motion parts, divide the difference by the remainder for days with the remainder as parts, and add or subtract the result from the general-use accumulation — add for evening appearance and subtract for morning concealment.","Then set that segment's first-day motion parts, subtract one hundred parts, and take the remainder.","The Chinese unit is only 乃置其段初日行分，減去一百分，餘; the before invents division of the difference and evening-appearance/morning-concealment add/subtract steps absent from this unit, and the proposed remainder-only wording matches the source bound.","high","applied"]
  ],
